# The SQLite stores must NOT ship in the image: the app seeds them on first
# boot (app.py / sources.py), which keeps every seeded date relative to NOW.
# Shipping a snapshot freezes the plant calendar and lets CTP/PO dates drift
# into the past as real time passes.
data/erp.db
data/sources.db

# build/dev artefacts irrelevant to the runtime image
.git
__pycache__
*.pyc
shots
dop-evidence
*.pptx
*.docx
~$*
